# Folders: rename People (the preview lists every link that changes), move it into Guide,
# make a folder in it, then delete it to the trash and undo. tests/drive.rs adds Inbox/Links.md
# and Inbox/People.canvas, which link into People by path, and checks every link still resolves.
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace 36 notes
keys p johnston
wait-for David A. Johnston
keys enter
wait-for People/David A. Johnston  reading
keys esc
wait-gone reading · Esc / q back
keys h R
wait-for rename · ⏎ preview · Esc cancel
expect new name: People
keys ctrl+u
type Volcanologists
keys enter
wait-for People/  →  Volcanologists/
expect 3 notes move with it.
expect 5 links in 2 files will be updated:
expect ▤ Inbox/Links  3 links
expect [[Volcanologists/David A. Johnston]] and [Krafft](../Volcanologists/Katia%20and%20Maurice%20Krafft.md)
expect ▤ Inbox/People.canvas  2 links
screen
keys enter
wait-for renamed the folder to Volcanologists · 5 links updated in 2 files
expect Volcanologists/David A. Johnston  reader
expect ▾ Volcanologists
expect-not ▾ People
keys m
wait-for move to folder · ⏎ preview
keys ctrl+u
type Guide
keys enter
wait-for Volcanologists/  →  Guide/Volcanologists/
keys enter
wait-for moved the folder to Guide/Volcanologists · 5 links updated in 2 files
expect Guide/Volcanologists/David A. Johnston  reader
keys N
wait-for new folder · ⏎ create · Esc cancel
type Field Notes
keys enter
wait-for created Guide/Volcanologists/Field Notes/
expect example-workspace 36 notes
keys h d
wait-for Delete Guide/Volcanologists/?
expect It holds 3 notes, and everything else in it.
expect 5 files link to them from outside: Links, Mount St. Helens, People.canvas, Pyroclastic Flow, Vesuvius.
expect y delete · n cancel
screen
keys y
wait-for deleted Volcanologists · u undo
wait-for example-workspace 33 notes
expect-not Guide/Volcanologists/David A. Johnston  reader
keys u
wait-for restored Guide/Volcanologists
wait-for example-workspace 36 notes
expect ▾ Volcanologists
expect Field Notes
keys q
exits 0
